# `toint` gives an `int`, null when the value does not fit 32 bits.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| where orderId == 'o-0001'
| project a = toint('2147483647'), b = toint('2147483648'), c = toint(3.99), d = toint(false), e = toint(5000000000)
---- expected
a          | b    | c   | d   | e
int        | int  | int | int | int
-----------+------+-----+-----+-----
2147483647 | null |   3 |   0 | null
